  "comment": [
    "Every 401 and 403 body of sessions spec \u00a76.6 by code (a \"/variant\" suffix names the second message of a code) and transport kind where the code can occur, and GET /api/session by via (\u00a76.11).",
    "Volatile values are written as \"<id>\" (a session id), \"<ms>\" (a time) and \"<build>\". On http a session (and so session_expired, or a login that reaches the password check) and a Basic credential that reaches the password check need GOBLIN_INSECURE_HTTP_SESSIONS=1, hence insecureAllowed true there; without it, Basic there gets 403 https_required.",
    "Phase 0 contract (frozen): changed only through the integrator, with the agreement of every lane that uses it."
  ],
